{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16217380","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16217380","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1621738001:1":{"text":"ご、ごめんなさい！そんなつもりはなかったんだ……急ぎで彼を探してて、スケジュール表みたいなものがないかと……","source_cn":"对、对不起！我们不是故意翻吉罗德课本的……我们有急事找...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FC84F69A8B35479","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621738002:1":{"text":"ジロードを探してるの？それならさっき<style=\"highlight\">図書館</style>で見かけたよ。","source_cn":"你们要找吉罗德？我刚刚在<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34867A0B82CC7A30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621738003:1":{"text":"でもなんだかうわの空で、声を掛けても気付かなかった。きっと大事な試験のことで悩んでるんだろうな。","source_cn":"但他好像有点心不在焉，和他打招呼他都没听见，估计是在为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF83EE33687F8667","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621738004:1":{"text":"よかったら、その急用ってのを聞いてもいいかな？あっ、僕はエクト。ジロードの親友だから、代わりに聞いといてあげるよ。彼は試験勉強で忙しいんだ。","source_cn":"能问问你们找他有什么急事吗？我叫厄克特，是吉罗德的好朋...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9355748C18CEF577","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1621738005:1":{"text":"子ども扱いされてるなぁ……遊びに誘いに来たとでも思われてそうで、ちょっとムカつく……","source_cn":"看来是被当成来找吉罗德玩的小孩子了……总觉得有点不爽！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B36488FEF73DDDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1621738006:1":{"text":"仕方ないわよ。だって本当に子どもなんだから。","source_cn":"没办法，我们本来就是小孩子啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8755E10F72314626","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1621738007:1":{"text":"ところで、いつジロードとは知り合ったの？君たちの話なんて聞いたことなかったから。","source_cn":"对了，你们是在哪里认识吉罗德的？他之前从没和我提过呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C26692574ADF0F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1621738008:1":{"text":"この前、商店街でだよ！危うく悪徳商人にお金を騙し取られそうなところを、彼が助けてくれたんだ……","source_cn":"是在商业街！我们差点被一个坏老板骗钱，是吉罗德帮忙……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F716B0FED129E10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:11:1621738009:1":{"text":"子どもたちは、商店街での経緯をエクトに語った……","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B64BD04D64F3C10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1621738010:1":{"text":"ちょっと待って！今、ジロードがクビになったって言った……？","source_cn":"等等，你们说，吉罗德被辞退了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81C9401853D1B206","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title"